gxp 2

given
  segment OA
    d1: |OA| = 1.2
    θ1: angle(xaxis, OA) = 70°

construct
  point B on xaxis
  segment AB
    d2: |AB| = 4

find
  x_B: x(B)

where
  A (0.4104241719908026, 1.12763114494309)
  B (4.248190188953579, 6.986410453395435e-23)
  d1 label (0.3, 0.3)
  θ1 label (0.3, 0.3)
  d2 label (0.3, 0.3)
  x_B label (0.3, 0.3)
